{"unit_id": "s17765152890-gif__dsh-usage-quota#feature-1", "repo": "s17765152890-gif/dsh-usage-quota", "commit": "1f65b52abe55b57e32f5e933b6115ad3227d3b2f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-usage-quota 的功能「供应商额度卡片」：在对话输入框下方显示当前供应商的额度结果；支持 OpenCode Go 用量窗口、DeepSeek 账号余额和配置的通用余额接口。切换供应商时按对应路由查询，未知供应商不显示卡片。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:94-151", "lib/index.js:166-232"]}
{"unit_id": "s17765152890-gif__dsh-usage-quota#feature-2", "repo": "s17765152890-gif/dsh-usage-quota", "commit": "1f65b52abe55b57e32f5e933b6115ad3227d3b2f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-usage-quota 的功能「思考强度选择」：在模型选择器旁显示当前推理等级，点开后可选择模型支持的档位；选择后调用模型目录的选择接口应用，也可恢复模型默认强度。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:207-275"]}
{"unit_id": "s17765152890-gif__dsh-usage-quota#feature-3", "repo": "s17765152890-gif/dsh-usage-quota", "commit": "1f65b52abe55b57e32f5e933b6115ad3227d3b2f", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-usage-quota 的功能「自定义余额适配」：通过 providers 配置余额接口地址、凭据引用和显示名称；读取响应中的 balance、remaining 或 quota.remaining，并可显示当天用量。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:101-145", "lib/index.js:209-232"]}
